                "f"
              ],
              [
                "Orbital ki shape",
                "spherical (gend jaisi)",
                "polar (dumb bell)",
                "cloverleaf (double dumbbell)",
                "complicated (pechida)"
              ],
              [
                "Subshell ke electrons, 2(2ℓ + 1)",
                "2",
                "6",
                "10",
                "14"
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Kisi shell mein subshells ki tadaad us ke shell number ke barabar hai: pehle, doosre, teesre aur chauthe shell mein bil-tarteeb ek, do, teen aur chaar subshells."
          },
