          {
            "type": "callout",
            "tone": "tip",
            "title": "Asaan alfaaz mein",
            "text": "ℓ hamesha n se kam hota hai. Is liye pehle shell mein sirf s, doosre mein s aur p, teesre mein s, p, d, aur chauthe mein s, p, d, f. Isi liye ‘1p’ ya ‘2d’ jaisa koi subshell nahi hota."
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "Mukhtasar khulasa"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              "ℓ = 0 se (n − 1): shape batata hai. 0 = s (spherical), 1 = p (dumb bell), 2 = d (cloverleaf), 3 = f (complicated).",
              "Ek jaise n aur ℓ wale orbitals = subshell; electrons 2(2ℓ + 1) = 2, 6, 10, 14.",
              "Shell mein subshells = shell number."
